🚀 How to Run
Prerequisites

Azure subscription with ADLS Gen2 and Databricks workspace
Unity Catalog enabled on Databricks
Access Connector configured between Databricks and ADLS

Setup Steps

Upload raw data to ADLS raw landing container
Run Unity Catalog setup (setup/unity_catalog_setup.sql) to create catalog, schemas, and external volume
Execute notebooks in order:

Bronze ingestion (dim → fact)
Silver transformation (dim → fact)
Gold aggregation (dim → fact → daily summary)


Configure Databricks Jobs for daily_refresh_dim and daily_refresh_fact
Connect Power BI to Gold layer Delta tables via Databricks connector


💡 Key Design Decisions
DecisionReasonAuto Loader for fact ingestionScalable incremental file detection without manual trackingDelta Lake for all layersACID compliance, time travel, schema evolutionChange Data Feed on Silver/GoldEnables efficient incremental processing downstreamforeachBatch + MERGE patternHandles late-arriving data and upserts reliablyUnity Catalog governanceCentralized access control and metadata across all layersDaily summary pre-aggregationReduces query load on Power BI, improves dashboard performance

📊 Power BI Integration
Gold layer Delta tables are connected to Power BI via the Azure Databricks connector. Dashboards consume:

gld_dim_products, gld_dim_customers for dimension context
gld_fact_order_items for transaction-level analysis
gld_fact_daily_orders_summary for daily KPI tracking
